mNf5R9NR1IftSlEMOoNN0EgN6liOBUxXbw&oe=6AEB343C"}, {"file_name": "[4] ScreenShot_2560_1440.png", "id": "865550875790351", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57572944_865550879123684_1477335097746044158_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UT_RI53RA7kQ7kNvwE3xZQf&_nc_oc=AdqWrQ4js_B2PqluzUoq7pYkC1dZull5fIOjsuSd_gRgvLiEAfYOJcIKajmgo7oABag&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQknqbLtZzxyK3T4wNUzEuufj3VHuih01sPaSAQ14igbg&oe=6AEB4AD4"}, {"file_name": "38974514_1829127470903909_1399457844888075062_n.png", "id": "1215071269773735", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974919_1215071273107068_5114355894187856332_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=aKDwnxBD_I4Q7kNvwGJUleC&_nc_oc=Adroe0TAp6Jp8Tub-uQKLMRrTwqE2lRF2OfD8fY2Mj5hiGG_fE1zAUuB911c6DioHaQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQPZWQFi68I21_In_kRfQIEv5ZP9zB8wOxPku7Mbm0ZnQ&oe=6AEB5F23"}, {"file_name": "39031376_392476136956384_6692953177985008520_n.png", "id": "1716747332443731", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031363_1716747335777064_31031909917453077_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2KVqn5W_-GsQ7kNvwFKuWiu&_nc_oc=AdqGJA7zq0hGmMzBcDwF8wsPlBNMlzbO0zPrRBPtrg33blSU0kxu7wJTj63-W-E9rlM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR-GpE5AuKMH4gKUQFJGiXInZNLfNjnLgMRAuFj26HYag&oe=6AEB6237"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Landscape_Halloween2026_Yellow.png", "id": "2262677014599566", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620666_2262677017932899_1542635521432891220_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qhXjum-86LAQ7kNvwHOu-Pd&_nc_oc=AdoEvWunTMgZeKCM_mdmXyr4Ep912Q4LrnV-TeLFZrrqz2MWTN3NXb3asMypPCoXvaM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTElwiJWWuiJcu28ftub6LrP_ijX26BmKdvBrJdp3Lr3Q&oe=6AEB35DD"}, "display_name": "Real VR Fishing", "keywords": ["Fishing", "Simulation", "Relax", "Graphic", "Multiplayer"], "long_description": "The Most Relaxing Fishing Trip in VR \u2014 Real VR Fishing\n\nCast your line across meticulously recreated real-world landscapes. 40 maps and 150+ species in the base game expand to 100+ fishing spots and 300+ species with DLC. Whether you're a first-timer or a seasoned angler, enjoy  at your own pace in a calm, unhurried world.\n\n{3548238332152195}\n\n**Cast, Wait, Feel the Bite**\n\nFrom casting to reeling, every action delivers lifelike resistance. Keep it easy in Normal Mode, or test your skills  in Expert Mode.\n{1498009741482882}\n\n\n**Solo, or Up to 4 Players Together**\n\nShare the same fishing spot with friends, chat in real time, and enjoy the catch together. Real VR Fishing is more than a game,  it's a place to unwind together.\n\n{1399520467849499}\n\n\n**Collect, Progress, Customize**\n\nLevel up, release rare fish, and build out your avatar and your own personal aquarium. \n\nShow your flair by changing up your avatar with our many costume packs. Proudly display your catches in your personal aquarium, and add a touch of beauty with rocks, greenery and trophies from events.\n\n{1008705684725742}\n\n\n**A New Adventure: Picnic Festa DLC**\n\nExplore 7 picnic-themed locations across the US, Spain, and Japan. Rescue Chubby Fish and Starving Sharks, and restore balance to a strangely evolving ecosystem.\n\n{9478889015499392}\n\n**Always Growing**\n\nWinner of Oculus Game of the Year 2019. Regular  updates and seasonal events keep adding new species and challenges.\n\nFor more contents and information, join our anglers' Discord!\nhttps://discord.gg/sUwKtzFvnM\n", "short_description": "Join our anglers' Discord! \nhttps://discord.gg/sUwKtzFvnM\n\n\nThe Most Relaxing Fishing Trip in VR \u2014 Real VR Fishing\n\nCast your line across meticulously recreated real-world landscapes. 40 maps and 150+ species in the base game expand to 100+ fishing spots and 300+ species with DLC. Whether you're a first-timer or a seasoned angler, enjoy  at your own pace in a calm, unhurried world."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1101784809260282", "locale": "es_LA", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Real VR Pesca", "keywords": ["pesca", "real", "simulaci\u00f3n", "relajaci\u00f3n", "gr\u00e1fico"], "long_description": "\ud83c\udfa3 Encuentra tu escape en Real VR Fishing\n\nDeja atr\u00e1s el bullicio diario y sum\u00e9rgete en uno de los mundos m\u00e1s hermosos y relajantes de la realidad virtual.\n\nYa sea que est\u00e9s buscando atrapar peces trofeo, relaj\u00e1ndote junto a un lago de monta\u00f1a o compartiendo momentos con amigos en una costa soleada, Real VR Fishing es tu refugio personal, siempre que lo necesites.\n\n{821029507568370}\n\n\ud83c\udf0e Un mundo por explorar\n\nLanza tu anzuelo en m\u00e1s de 40 incre\u00edbles lugares de pesca en Corea, Estados Unidos y Jap\u00f3n.\n\nExpande tu aventura con paquetes DLC y descubre m\u00e1s de 100 impresionantes ubicaciones y m\u00e1s de 300 especies de peces para coleccionar.\n\n{675755565042385}\n\n\ud83d\udc1f Mejora, personaliza y colecciona\n\nPasa de pescador principiante a maestro pescador.\n\nPersonaliza tu avatar, construye tu propio acuario y captura peces raros para mostrar tu destreza.\n\n{1236877561160943}\n\n\ud83c\udfa7 Tu compa\u00f1ero de pesca ideal\n\nEscucha tu m\u00fasica favorita, navega por internet o mira videos sin abandonar tu lugar de pesca.\n\nCon Real VR Fishing, cada sesi\u00f3n es un verdadero momento de relajaci\u00f3n.\n\n{1269303301220181}\n\nFunciones adicionales:\n\n\ud83c\udfa3 Pesca solo o junto a hasta 3 amigos \u2014 con chat de voz para compartir la experiencia.\n\n\ud83c\udfc6 Ganador del premio Oculus al Mejor Juego de 2019 \u2014 con actualizaciones mensuales y eventos de temporada que mantienen la frescura.\n\n\ud83c\udf1f Tu para\u00edso te espera\n\nPaz real. Belleza real. Real VR Fishing.\n\nTu pr\u00f3xima gran escapada est\u00e1 a solo un lanzamiento de distancia.\n\n{1079966303971754}\n\nPara obtener m\u00e1s contenido e informaci\u00f3n, \u00a1\u00fanete a nuestro Discord para pescadores!\nhttps://discord.gg/sUwKtzFvnM\n", "short_description": "\ud83c\udfa3 Encuentra tu escape en Real VR Fishing\n\nDeja atr\u00e1s el bullicio diario y sum\u00e9rgete en uno de los mundos m\u00e1s hermosos y relajantes de la realidad virtual.\n\nYa sea que est\u00e9s buscando atrapar peces trofeo, relaj\u00e1ndote junto a un lago de monta\u00f1a o compartiendo momentos con amigos en una costa soleada, Real VR Fishing es tu refugio personal, siempre que lo necesites.\n\nPara obtener m\u00e1s contenido e informaci\u00f3n, \u00a1\u00fanete a nuestro Discord para pescadores!\nhttps://discord.gg/sUwKtzFvnM"}]}, "developer_name": "Devs United Games, Inc.", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.realvrfishing.com/privacy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Devs United Games, Inc.", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.realvrfishing.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "1023770785722696"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["RELAXATION_MEDITATION", "SPORTS", "ARCADE"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "ko", "ja", "de", "fr", "es_MX", "zh_CN", "zh_TW"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING", "OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "SINGLE_USER", "CO_OP"], "id": "29545528645044388"}, "revie